#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD0061 expect=skipped domain=DM
#note "A Library is staged but NO #define-xml: $define_datasets (define_dataset_names) needs the sponsor Define-XML, so the rule SKIPs (never a PASS over an empty declared-dataset list). The body is the invalid one (with the define it fires). W4 (PLAN-list-functions phase 0, scenarios-first on the pre-port engine)."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset DM label="Demographics"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
---
S1 | DM | S1-001
